---
title: Writing — Ross Breadmore
layout: home.njk
---

<div class="page-intro">
  <h2 class="page-intro-title">Writing</h2>
  <p class="page-intro-sub">Posts on design, product, AI, and working life.</p>
  <p class="page-intro-link">For more, visit my <a href="https://rossbreadmore.medium.com/" target="_blank">Medium</a>.</p>
</div>

<ul class="post-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <span class="post-list-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
        <span class="post-list-date">{{ post.date | date("MMM yyyy") }}</span>
      </a>
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
